


Imveliso bhala: ['Number:'].
>> a := Inani + Inani + 1.
a := Inani - 2.
a := Inani × 2.
a := Inani ÷ 2.
Imveliso bhala: a.
Imveliso umgca-omtsha.

Imveliso bhala: ['String:'].
