Imveliso bhala: ['File:'].
Imveliso bhala: Ifayile funda.
Imveliso bhala: (Ifayile bhala: ['test']).
Imveliso bhala: (Ifayile yongeza-ekugqibeleni: ['test']).
Imveliso bhala: Ifayile cima.
Imveliso bhala: Ifayile ikhona.
Imveliso bhala: Ifayile include.
Imveliso bhala: Ifayile qala.
