Imveliso bhala: ['Array:'].
Imveliso bhala: Uluhlu thatha-eyokugqibela.
Imveliso bhala: Uluhlu inani-lezinto.
Imveliso bhala: (((Uluhlu yongeza-ekugqibeleni: 999) umbhalo) buyisela: ['Lĳst'] nge: ['List']).
Imveliso bhala: Uluhlu inani-lezinto.
Imveliso bhala: Uluhlu thatha-eyokuqala.
Imveliso bhala: (Uluhlu dibanisa: [',']).
>> f := Uluhlu entsha.
Imveliso bhala: f inani-lezinto. 
Imveliso umgca-omtsha.

Imveliso bhala: ['Map:'].
Imveliso bhala: Isichazimagama inani-lezinto.
Imveliso bhala: (Isichazimagama beka: ['a'] kwindawo: ['b'])  inani-lezinto. 
